      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Build a DAK's library from the L1 sources its Component 1 cites, and the L1 knowledge graph that records them. Read when starting or extending a DAK library, when a DAK's guidance changes, and before writing any L1 graph for a DAK. Covers fetching a cited WHO IRIS item, ingesting it, extracting the Component 1 graph, and the two validators it must pass."
        }
      ],
