        {
          "@value": "Which layer a WHO SMART asset, rule, script or page belongs to — fhir-harness, smart-base (with its L1 and DAK document kinds) or smart-ig — and the one question that settles it. Read before adding anything to fhir-harness, smart-base or smart-ig, before creating a per-IG harness, and before moving a pre/post-processing step."
        }
      ],
